{"candidateAnswer":"Hiking outdoors and playing board games together on weekends.","evidence":"[D1:10 | 7:31 pm on 21 January, 2022] Joanna: Yeah! Besides writing, I also enjoy reading, watching movies, and exploring nature. Anything else you enjoy doing, Nate?\n[D1:11 | 7:31 pm on 21 January, 2022] Nate: Playing video games and watching movies are my main hobbies.\n[D1:12 | 7:31 pm on 21 January, 2022] Joanna: Cool, Nate! So we both have similar interests. What type of movies do you like best?\n[D3:4 | 9:27 am on 7 February, 2022] Nate: Thanks, Joanna. Not much has changed for me, but I just discovered that I can make coconut milk icecream and gave it a try. It was actually pretty good, so I'm proud of myself.\n[D4:9 | 1:07 pm on 25 February, 2022] Nate: Thanks, Joanna! It means a lot that you enjoy the desserts I bake.\n[D10:9 | 11:54 am on 2 May, 2022] Joanna: Not much is new other than the screenplay. Been working on some projects and testing out dairy-free dessert recipes for friends and fam. Here's a pic of a cake I made recently!\n[D20:2 | 6:03 pm on 5 September, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate! Cute turtles! Bummer about the setback. Any positive vibes comin' your way? I just revised on of my old recipes and made this!","itemId":"urn:uuid:666d92c2-4347-5f57-b453-52c04e0cf964","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:92c8a61697fc47cd612707a6af0e84a87ae467b5b4739c7e1378d1a840042d52","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of interests do Joanna and Nate share?","referenceAnswer":"Watching movies, making desserts","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"92c8a61697fc47cd612707a6af0e84a87ae467b5b4739c7e1378d1a840042d52"}}]}